    "module_designation": null,
    "description": "The WM-AI model is a Class III, self-indicating, dual-interval, non-automatic weighing instrument with wrapping and label printing devices. The IP-AI model is a weigh-price labelling instrument with similar characteristics and operation, but without the wrapping function. The instruments are not designed for direct sales to the public. Weighing module mounted in the in-feed conveyor section within a stainless steel framework; load cell mounted in an enclosed housing; LCD touch screen display and keyboard; up to three thermal label printers/applicators; wrapping device (WM-AI) with up to two film rolls; interfaces: Ethernet, USB. Devices: initial zero setting, semi-automatic zero setting, zero tracking, zero indicator, net indicator, semi-automatic subtractive tare, preset tare, gravity compensation, price-computing, PLUs. Access to the load cell, electronics and calibration switch is prevented by a tamper-evident seal."
